<title>USA: Garnet Resources says hires adviser.</title>
<headline>Garnet Resources says hires adviser.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Garnet Resources Corp said Wednesday it has engaged Rauscher Pierce Refsnes Inc to act as its adviser in pursuing various strategic alternatives for maximizing shareholder value.</p>
<p>Garnet is engaged in international oil and gas exploration activities, principally in Colombia and Papua New Guinea.</p>
